close_reason: "A custom field flag or alias must be one option spelling, and short spellings and implicit help are reserved"
contract_change:
  api: "pm schema add-field, pm schema rename-field, pm profile apply and pm profile lint for custom field flags and aliases"
  before: "A flag or alias holding a pipe, comma, whitespace, = or brackets, a malformed short flag, a short flag a command already owns (-p) and -h or help were stored; a stored pipe alias made the commands it reached fail during registration and -h made help demand a value"
  after: "They are refused with schema_field_flag_invalid or schema_field_option_collision, profile lint reports field_flag_invalid, validate --check-metadata reports stored spellings as validate_schema_field_flag_invalid, and the CLI skips such a stored spelling when it registers field options"
  migrate: Pass one spelling per --alias and pick a short flag the command does not own; re-register a stored field the validate warning names with pm schema add-field <key> --cli-flag <flag> --alias <alias>
escape_class: production_defect
gate_evidence:
  disposition: gate_added
  owner: pm-8patuh
  gate_id: schema-field-flag-spelling
  negative_control: "On 2026.11.23 schema add-field with --alias full|deep is stored and pm list -h then fails during registration with conflicting flag --full, and --alias=-h makes pm search -h demand a value; field-flag-spellings.spec.ts requires a typed refusal and working help"
  local_checks[1]: node scripts/run-tests.mjs test -- tests/unit/sdk/schema/field-flag-spellings.spec.ts tests/unit/sdk/schema/field-option-collisions.spec.ts
  hosted_checks[2]: Gates (coverage),Gates (static)
